<title>FRANCE: ATHLETICS-KIPKETER SETS 800 METRES INDOOR WORLD RECORD.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-KIPKETER SETS 800 METRES INDOOR WORLD RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wilson Kipketer of Denmark set a men's 800 metres indoor world record of one minute 43.96 seconds at the world indoor athletics championships on Friday.</p>
<p>Kipketer broke the previous best mark of 1:44.84 set by Paul Ereng of Kenya in March 1989 in Budapest.</p>
